---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/main.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="Terms of Service"
  description="The terms and conditions for using icebenitez.com, a web development portfolio by Ice Benitez."
>
  <main class="mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 md:py-20">
    <article class="space-y-8">
      <header class="space-y-3">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
          <strong class="text-foreground">Effective Date:</strong> April 22, 2025
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="space-y-6 leading-7 text-muted-foreground [&_strong]:text-foreground [&_h2]:mt-10 [&_h2]:text-xl [&_h2]:font-semibold [&_h2]:tracking-tight [&_p]:mt-4">
        <p>
          Welcome to <strong>icebenitez.com</strong>. This website is maintained
          by a product engineer to showcase personal work, skills, and projects.
          By accessing or using this website, you agree to these Terms of Service.
        </p>

        <h2>1. Use of the Website</h2>
        <p>
          You may browse and interact with the site content for personal or
          informational purposes. You may not use this site for illegal or harmful
          activities.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>
          All content on this website, including code samples, designs, and
          written content, is owned by the site owner unless otherwise stated. Do
          not copy or reuse content without permission.
        </p>

        <h2>3. No Warranties</h2>
        <p>
          This website is provided “as is” without any warranties, expressed or
          implied. While efforts are made to keep content accurate and secure,
          icebenitez.com makes no guarantees.
        </p>

        <h2>4. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          icebenitez.com shall not be held liable for any indirect, incidental, or
          consequential damages arising from the use of this site.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Changes</h2>
        <p>
          Terms may be updated from time to time. Continued use of the site means
          you accept the latest version.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
</MainLayout>
